# Design Synthesis

Synthesize discovery findings into the canonical design.md sections.

## Rules
- The Boundary Map and the File Structure Plan SHALL be consistent.
- Every requirement appears in the Requirements Traceability table.
- Every component has Intent, Requirements, Responsibilities, Dependencies, Contract.
- Trade-offs and rejected alternatives are recorded with reasons.

## Anti-patterns
- design.md over 1,000 lines — split the spec.
- Components without contracts.
- Flows that skip error paths.
